  "ingredients": [
    "5 pounds leg of lamb",
    "4 cloves garlic, sliced",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 tablespoons fresh rosemary"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7k07nYH731y7Sj3AwTuGcXyS15I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-9380-roast-leg-of-lamb-VAT-4x3-step-01-2ec0321b954d43c0b747c8c716d190b7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9380/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut deep slits on the top of leg of lamb every 3 to 4 inches; push slices of garlic down into the slits. Generously season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PupzEh1JoafG3NQId69u7U3ksss=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-9380-roast-leg-of-lamb-VAT-4x3-step-02-5586e2fe8e274ecfb4b86599a1fbe1d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9380/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place lamb on a roasting pan; arrange several sprigs of fresh rosemary under and on top of the lamb.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NON67SAzuXD5i4Dqk5LyuDiFUY0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-9380-roast-leg-of-lamb-VAT-4x3-step-03-76212ff031604e948ca9a0151b32b192.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9380/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast in the preheated oven for 1 3/4 to 2 hours, or until an instant-read thermometer inserted into the center of the lamb reads at least 135 degrees F (57 degrees C) for medium-rare to medium doneness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ohiqgxERr7rGqq8N4GLYjpTlNcg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-9380-roast-leg-of-lamb-VAT-4x3-step-04-f9b53669d830417aa4a9aab283be3340.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9380/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover lamb with aluminum foil and let rest for at least 10 minutes before carving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pr5GYHClsa1efRZRSAqqayITef4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-9380-roast-leg-of-lamb-VAT-4x3-step-05-c81574abdd1144bf9885561dd3d900dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9380/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with your favorite sides, enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aGnFssBSsRXcHc-_Ol9cmepzx4U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-9380-roast-leg-of-lamb-VAT-hero-4x3-cabe2cac19f445158bedf59c71af4bae.jpg"
